            text: "For most furniture, a water-based polyurethane \u2014 it stays clear, does not yellow over time, and has almost no odour. Choose oil-based when you want the warm amber tone it adds to walnut, cherry and oak, or when the piece is a hard-working table top that needs maximum film toughness.",
