          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Yes, provided the stain is fully dry \u2014 typically 24 hours for oil-based stain, longer in humid conditions. The one combination to be careful with is water-based poly over oil-based stain, which needs the stain properly cured or the finish can lift.",
